# Railway Ops (Shadow)

## Credentials (local only — never commit)

Railway API access lives in the **project root**:

```
.env.railway
```

Gitignored via `.env.*`. Contains `RAILWAY_API_TOKEN`, `RAILWAY_PROJECT_ID`, `RAILWAY_SERVICE`.

**Restore after wipe:** `.\scripts\setup_cursor_access.ps1` writes `.env.railway` and `.cursor/mcp.json`. Verify: `.\scripts\verify_cursor_access.ps1`.

All `scripts/railway_*.py` and `*_production_deploy.py` scripts load this file automatically. **Do not** paste the token into rules, commits, or chat.

